@host = http://127.0.0.1:8080
# Generate with: go run ./cmd/token
@token = replace-me

### Current principal
GET {{host}}/api/admin/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout (declares audit action auth.logout)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unauthenticated request should return 401
GET {{host}}/api/admin/v1/auth/me
